    <bpmn:process id="W_W735" name="W735. Customer Onboarding Journey Management &amp; First-90-Day Engagement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New loyalty member enrollment per W263; or trade/corporate account activation per W460
Frequency: ~5,000–8,000 new loyalty enrollments/month; ~50–100 new trade/corporate accounts/month
Volume: ~60,000–96,000 new customer onboarding journeys/year
Owner: Customer Experience Manager
Participants: Marketing Automation Specialist, Loyalty Program Manager, Trade Sales Manager, Customer Service
Source: workflow W735 — Customer Onboarding Journey Management &amp; First-90-Day Engagement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W735_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W735_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W735_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W735_Start3" name="New loyalty member enrollment per W263; or trade/corporate account activation per W460">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task4" name="Welcome communication (Day 0-1)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Welcome communication (Day 0-1): upon enrollment, system triggers automated welcome sequence: (a) email/SMS: welcome to BuildRight loyalty program, explain tier benefits, current point balance, how to earn/redeem; (b) digital loyalty card via mobile app per W263; (c) first-purchase incentive: welcome coupon (e.g., 10% off next purchase within 30 days) with unique barcode tracked per W539; (d) for trade/corporate accounts: personal welcome call from Trade Sales Manager within 2 business days per W617
Responsible (R): System / Trade Sales Mgr
Accountable (A): Customer Experience Mgr
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task5" name="First-purchase engagement (Day 7-14)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: First-purchase engagement (Day 7-14): if customer has not made first purchase within 14 days: (a) system triggers re-engagement email: highlight personalized product recommendations based on enrollment preferences (e.g., &quot;Just joined as a contractor? Check out our Pro Desk&quot;); (b) include extended welcome coupon (if original expired); (c) for trade accounts: Trade Sales Manager follow-up call to schedule first store visit or pro desk introduction per W112
Responsible (R): System / Trade Sales Mgr
Accountable (A): Customer Experience Mgr
Duration: Automated + 10-15 min per trade account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task6" name="First-purchase celebration (at first transaction)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: First-purchase celebration (at first transaction): when new loyalty member completes first purchase: (a) system triggers: (i) bonus points award (e.g., 2x points on first purchase); (ii) push notification: &quot;Great first purchase! You earned [X] bonus points&quot;; (iii) transaction receipt includes loyalty points summary; (b) for first B2B purchase: Trade Sales Manager sends personalized thank-you and introduces account manager for ongoing relationship per W617
Responsible (R): System / Trade Sales Mgr
Accountable (A): Customer Experience Mgr
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task7" name="30-day check-in">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: 30-day check-in: at 30 days post-enrollment: (a) system sends: (i) engagement summary: points earned, stores visited, categories purchased; (ii) educational content: &quot;Did you know?&quot; features (loyalty redemption, BOPIS, trade pricing if applicable); (iii) feedback request: quick 3-question survey on onboarding experience per W65; (b) for customers with zero purchases at 30 days: (i) escalate to re-engagement campaign per W618 churn prediction; (ii) offer re-activation incentive per W84; (c) for trade accounts: quarterly business review scheduling per W617
Responsible (R): System / Customer Experience Mgr
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10-15 min/day reviewing non-responders</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task8" name="60-day product education">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: 60-day product education: at 60 days: (a) system sends personalized product recommendations based on purchase history: (i) related categories to explore; (ii) seasonal promotions relevant to customer segment; (iii) new product launches per W564 in purchased categories; (b) invite to store events per W147 or DIY workshops; (c) for trade accounts: invite to contractor networking events or exclusive trade nights
Responsible (R): System / Marketing
Accountable (A): Customer Experience Mgr
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W735_Task9" name="90-day graduation assessment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: 90-day graduation assessment: at 90 days: (a) system classifies onboarding outcome: (i) Engaged (3+ purchases, active app usage): successful onboarding → transition to regular customer lifecycle management; (ii) Casual (1-2 purchases, minimal engagement): trigger second-chance engagement per W618 with enhanced incentive; (iii) Lapsed (0 purchases since enrollment): activate dormant account recovery per W560 and W84; (b) Customer Experience Manager reviews 90-day cohort data monthly: (i) onboarding conversion rate by channel (in-store vs. online vs. app); (ii) average time to first purchase; (iii) 90-day retention rate; (c) insights feed into enrollment process optimization per W263 and loyalty program design per W104
Responsible (R): System / Customer Experience Mgr
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2-3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W735_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W735_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W735_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W735_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-279 (ensure controlled execution — Loyalty Program Operations (PA-13.2).) | - operational: Customer Experience Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Customer Experience Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W735_Assoc12" sourceRef="W735_Annotation11" targetRef="W735_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W735_Flow13" sourceRef="W735_Start3" targetRef="W735_Task4" />
