    <bpmn:process id="W_W822" name="W822. Customer Loyalty Tier Benefit Fulfillment &amp; Welcome Package Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer loyalty tier upgrade detected by system per W515; new loyalty member enrollment per W263
Frequency: Weekly; ~5,000–8,000 tier upgrades (per W1291) and ~5,000–8,000 new enrollments per month
Volume: ~10,000–16,000 benefit fulfillment events per month (5,000–8,000 tier upgrades + 5,000–8,000 enrollments per the Frequency); active loyalty base ~600,000
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager
Participants: Loyalty Program Manager, CSR, Marketing Coordinator, Customer
Source: workflow W822 — Customer Loyalty Tier Benefit Fulfillment &amp; Welcome Package Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W822_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W822_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W822_Lane2" name="Loyalty Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W822_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W822_Start4" name="Customer loyalty tier upgrade detected by system per W515; new loyalty member enrollment…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W822_Task5" name="System detects tier upgrade per W515">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System detects tier upgrade per W515 or new enrollment per W263; triggers benefit fulfillment workflow
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W822_Task6" name="System generates benefit activation package">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System generates benefit activation package: (a) tier-specific benefits list, (b) activation date, (c) physical/digital card generation (Bronze/Silver: digital only; Gold/Platinum: physical + digital), (d) welcome offer or upgrade gift (e.g., Gold tier: PHP 500 voucher; Platinum: exclusive event invitation)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W822_Task7" name="For digital benefits">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For digital benefits: system activates immediately across all channels — POS per W5B, ecommerce per W11, mobile app per W615, partner locations per W674
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W822_Task8" name="For physical card">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For physical card: Loyalty Program Manager triggers card production batch (weekly print run for Gold/Platinum); system generates mailing label; card dispatched via courier or available for store pickup
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Batch: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W822_Task9" name="Welcome/upgrade communication sent per W708">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Welcome/upgrade communication sent per W708: (a) tier benefits summary with personalized content, (b) exclusive offer or welcome gift details, (c) how to maximize tier benefits guide, (d) next tier requirements and progress bar
Responsible (R): System / Marketing Coordinator
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W822_Task10" name="For Platinum tier">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: For Platinum tier: Loyalty Program Manager coordinates personalized onboarding — (a) dedicated account manager assignment per W103 territory, (b) exclusive shopping event invitation, (c) birthday/anniversary recognition setup
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15-20 min/customer</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W822_Task11" name="Monthly benefit fulfillment analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly benefit fulfillment analytics: (a) upgrade conversion rate, (b) physical card delivery SLA compliance, (c) benefit activation rate by tier, (d) upgrade-induced incremental revenue per W565
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: 3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W822_Task12" name="Quarterly benefit cost review per W104">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly benefit cost review per W104 financial governance: (a) cost per tier member, (b) ROI by tier, (c) benefit redesign recommendations
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4-6 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W822_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W822_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W822_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W822_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-279 (ensure controlled execution — Loyalty Program Operations (PA-13.2).) | - operational: Loyalty Program Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W822_Assoc15" sourceRef="W822_Annotation14" targetRef="W822_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow16" sourceRef="W822_Start4" targetRef="W822_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow17" sourceRef="W822_Task5" targetRef="W822_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow18" sourceRef="W822_Task6" targetRef="W822_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow19" sourceRef="W822_Task7" targetRef="W822_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow20" sourceRef="W822_Task8" targetRef="W822_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow21" sourceRef="W822_Task9" targetRef="W822_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow22" sourceRef="W822_Task10" targetRef="W822_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow23" sourceRef="W822_Task11" targetRef="W822_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W822_Flow24" sourceRef="W822_Task12" targetRef="W822_End13" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W822_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W822_plane" bpmnElement="W_W822">
