    <bpmn:process id="W_W1291" name="W1291. Customer Loyalty Tier Upgrade &amp; Benefits Personalization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer qualifies for loyalty tier upgrade based on accumulated spending; or annual tier re-evaluation cycle
Frequency: ~5,000–8,000 tier upgrades per month; annual re-evaluation for 600,000 members
Volume: Tier distribution: Bronze (~70%), Silver (~20%), Gold (~8%), Platinum (~2%)
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager
Participants: Loyalty Program Manager, Marketing, Customer, Store Sales Associate
Source: workflow W1291 — Customer Loyalty Tier Upgrade &amp; Benefits Personalization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1291_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1291_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1291_Lane2" name="Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1291_Lane3" name="Loyalty Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1291_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1291_Start5" name="Customer qualifies for loyalty tier upgrade based on accumulated spending; or annual tier…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1291_Task6" name="Tier qualification detection">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Tier qualification detection: System monitors customer spending accumulation in real-time: (a) when cumulative 12-month spend crosses tier threshold (e.g., PHP 50K for Silver, PHP 150K for Gold, PHP 500K for Platinum), (b) system auto-detects qualification, (c) checks for pending tier upgrade within 24 hours, (d) for annual re-evaluation: system runs batch process on anniversary date assessing trailing 12-month spend
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1291_Task7" name="Upgrade notification &amp; celebration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Upgrade notification &amp; celebration: System triggers tier upgrade communication: (a) personalized SMS: &quot;Congratulations! You&#x27;ve been upgraded to [TIER]! Enjoy [key benefits]&quot;, (b) email with digital tier badge, benefit summary, and personalized thank-you message from Store Manager of customer&#x27;s home store, (c) for Gold/Platinum: physical welcome kit mailed (loyalty card upgrade, exclusive catalog, partner discounts), (d) app push notification with animated tier badge unlock
Responsible (R): System / Marketing
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1291_Task8" name="Benefit activation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Benefit activation: System activates tier-specific benefits in real-time: (a) updated earn rate applied to next transaction (e.g., Silver: 1.2x, Gold: 1.5x, Platinum: 2x), (b) exclusive pricing tier activated at POS and ecommerce (e.g., Silver: 3% discount, Gold: 5%, Platinum: 8% on select items), (c) extended return window applied (Bronze: 14 days, Silver: 21 days, Gold: 30 days, Platinum: 45 days), (d) free delivery threshold lowered (Platinum: free delivery on all orders), (e) priority BOPIS pickup queue enabled
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1291_Task9" name="Personalized benefit generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Personalized benefit generation: Marketing generates personalized offers based on tier and purchase history: (a) birthday month: discount coupon (Silver: 10%, Gold: 15%, Platinum: 20%) on customer&#x27;s most-purchased category, (b) seasonal recommendations: if customer bought tiles in Q1 → suggest grout and adhesive promo in Q2, (c) project completion nudges: if customer bought plumbing materials → suggest fixture upgrade options, (d) Platinum exclusive: quarterly personalized catalog with curated products based on purchase history
Responsible (R): Marketing / System
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1291_Task10" name="Tier retention &amp; win-back">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Tier retention &amp; win-back: For customers at risk of tier downgrade (trailing spend trending below threshold): (a) system sends reminder 60 days before anniversary: &quot;You&#x27;re PHP X away from keeping your [TIER] status — shop now to maintain your benefits&quot;, (b) offer targeted bonus points promotion in at-risk categories, (c) if customer does downgrade: send graceful downgrade notification with encouragement to re-qualify, (d) 30-day post-downgrade: send targeted &quot;We miss you&quot; offer to drive re-engagement
Responsible (R): System / Marketing
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated + 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1291_Task11" name="Tier analytics &amp; program optimization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Tier analytics &amp; program optimization: Monthly, Loyalty Program Manager reviews: (a) tier distribution trends (shift toward higher or lower tiers), (b) average spend by tier (verify ROI of tier benefits), (c) upgrade/downgrade rates, (d) benefit utilization rate (what % of eligible members use each benefit), (e) personalized offer conversion rate, (f) recommend tier threshold or benefit adjustments to Marketing and VP Merchandising
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1291_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1291_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1291_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1291_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-279 (ensure controlled execution — Loyalty Program Operations (PA-13.2).) | - operational: Loyalty Program Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1291_Assoc14" sourceRef="W1291_Annotation13" targetRef="W1291_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
